{"unit_id":"phoushen__dsh-rea-toggle#card-zh","repo":"phoushen/dsh-rea-toggle","commit":"2ef56baef66add1244730693c194f5e8e3aaff2b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rea-toggle 是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的 REA MCP 开关。在对话输入框旁显示状态按钮，通过宿主 Web 端点读取状态并切换 REA 对应配置行的 disabled 标志。用户可查看 REA 当前是否启用，并在需要时开关服务；工具集合在 DSH 下次启动后更新。适合需要按场景启用或停用 REA MCP 工具的 DSH 用户。需要预先配置可启动 REA 的 MCP 行。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:114-124","index.js:174-210","index.js:106-129"]}
{"unit_id":"phoushen__dsh-rea-toggle#card-en","repo":"phoushen/dsh-rea-toggle","commit":"2ef56baef66add1244730693c194f5e8e3aaff2b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-rea-toggle adds a REA MCP switch beside the DSH Web conversation composer. It reads REA status and toggles the disabled flag on the matching profile configuration row through host Web endpoints. The tool set updates after DSH restarts. Users need an existing REA MCP row.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:114-124","index.js:174-210","index.js:106-129"]}
